             ChatbotPage.cs#RenderConversationState (_loadingHost TsSkeleton column); test Default_state_is_loading
[x] state  - empty   -> ChatbotState.Empty (ChatbotPageViewModel.DeriveContentState: messages.Count==0); rendered
             _emptyHost (Helix mark + howCanIHelp + askAbout + SuggestedPrompts); test
             Empty_feed_resolves_to_the_empty_conversation_state
