# Projection_resolves_every_required_string records the 13 keys through a RecordingLocalizer
# (Manifest_requires_thirteen_distinct_strings pins the count at 13 distinct + equal to ChatbotRegistration.
# RequiredStringKeys); Projection_resolves_the_web_default_chrome asserts the web English defaults for all 13;
# the three data states are asserted by Default_state_is_loading, Empty_feed_resolves_to_the_empty_conversation_state
# and Loaded_sessions_and_history_resolve_to_the_success_state (+ error/retry, new-session, history-toggle); the
# five bound data sources by Sending_a_message_binds_send_then_refreshes_sessions, Renaming_binds_rename_then_
# refreshes_sessions, Deleting_the_active_session_binds_delete_and_resets_the_conversation and the session/history
# load tests; the session + message projections, the tolerant wire parsers (ParseList / ParseMessages /
# ParseSendResult) and the PII-safe Diagnostics (view.opened slug=ChatbotPage) complete it. The two GlassPanels
# are view symbols (ChatbotPage.cs#_conversationPanel / #_thinkingPanel) exercised by the app build (the WinUI
# view is not headless-testable; its per-region content is driven by the asserted ChatbotDisplay projection).

